full_review:
DISACKING! Not to go back or recommend! Location;
The availability of an employee to offer to make eggs, for breakfast; The stay in general was a disappointment.
Very little friendly employees;
Rotes, did not clean the room and exchange the hangers after the first night, because we would have to ask the same, something that never informed us that it would have to be requested; After complaint of the situation, they only gave us a sheet of bed and bogs and suggested that we ourselves change the bedding;
Curtain of the bathtub with moisture;
To use/ change/ turn on/ off the air conditioner had to go to the room for someone from the reception because the commands could not be in our power;
Very modest breakfast;
During the dawn when we arrived, we realized that they remove the pressure from the water from the shower, we had to contact the reception to resolve the issue;

My stay was terrible! Not to repeat! Hotel near Metro; Slowness and oblivion of the staff (check in it took more than 30 minutes and tried to charge the tourist fee twice);
The three reserved rooms were dirty, the door did not open or close easily, some lights were burned, the air conditioning command was not present in one of the rooms and there was no way to turn off (attempts were made in receipt to solve this problem, but all were denied and we ended up sleeping very cold!);
There is no insulation in the room, the walls are thin and everything is heard (including the movement of other guests); 
At night he began hearing a loud noise of music at the reception. It was impossible to sleep like this;
Accommodation has no accessibility, since there are only one bid of stairs and not an elevator;
